# Smart Document Digitizer & OCR Portal

A pure Java web application built with **Spring Boot 3**, **Thymeleaf**, **Apache PDFBox**, and **Tesseract OCR (Tess4J)** that extracts searchable text and structured invoice data from digital PDFs, scanned PDFs, and images.

## Key Features
- **Hybrid OCR Pipeline:** Uses Apache PDFBox for instant text extraction on digital PDFs and falls back to Tesseract OCR (via Tess4J) for scanned PDFs and PNG/JPG images.
- **Structured Invoice Extraction:** Automatically parses invoice numbers, vendor names, dates, and total amounts.
- **Human-in-the-Loop Review:** Split-screen preview to inspect extracted text, correct fields, and mark documents as reviewed.
- **Search & Multi-Format Export:** Full-text search across uploaded documents and one-click export to **CSV**, **Excel (.xlsx)**, and **PDF**.

## How to Run Locally
1. Install **Java 21**, **Maven**, and **Tesseract OCR** (`C:\Program Files\Tesseract-OCR`).
2. Run the application:
   ```bash
   mvn spring-boot:run
